          "width": 1100,
          "content": "Three journeys share this file because they share one product area: the household's banks and the accounts they bring in. J03 brings a bank in, J04 keeps its balances current, J05 takes it back out. Placeholder data is a euro household with one bank; the country and gateway are an open decision recorded in zone 90.",
