              "fontWeight": "bold"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jZKhM",
              "name": "Path note",
              "fill": "$ui:color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Banks cap consent, at 180 days for most of them, and open banking has no renewal: restoring is the authorisation flow again. So this is not an edge case, it is where every connection ends up. It re-enters J03.A at the hand-off, skipping the picker because the bank is already known, and returns to the chooser because the bank issues new identifiers and may offer a different set of accounts.",
              "fontFamily": "$ui:type-family-body",
              "fontSize": "$ui:type-size-body-md",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
